# ─── Personal data — NEVER commit ────────────────────────────────────────
# rsvp_data.db is written next to the app on every run and holds real
# colleagues' names, email addresses and gift-contribution amounts. It was
# committed to this public repository once already; scripts/check_no_pii.py
# now fails CI if it comes back.
rsvp_data.db
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

